  "correctValue": "422",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> are independent events<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>S</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>S</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>S</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br />Case <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>:</mo></math><br /><math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Number</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ways</mi><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p><br />Case <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>:</mo></math><br /><math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfen